(Side note: your new token created a separate org `small-deploy` — existing apps live in `personal`, and the user token covers both, so I'll keep deploys in `personal`. No migration needed.)","timestamp":"2026-09-04T02:25:11.034Z"},{"id":"m2004","original_text_sha256":"103ad2d9b89d35fd7aa034cc09f8773a55c259d1d0dccece0b496e19a08aa397","redacted":false,"role":"assistant","source_line":2004,"source_message_id":"32d0659e-dd3a-466f-8e35-fd80bc199716","text":"Spike passes — mint works, own app 200, other app **403**. Wiring it all up:","timestamp":"2026-09-04T02:26:25.727Z"},{"id":"m2077","original_text_sha256":"b19e337a613765dd441ab906750cd4f03e5232c2242e06abedae3234ba172911","redacted":false,"role":"assistant","source_line":2077,"source_message_id":"d2448f62-fda1-4379-8b86-ff2d04482119","text":"Done — shipped and live, pushed as `f9026a7`. Full suite **9/9 in 84s** including a real counter deploy through the new flow.

